# Vars required by the openclaw service.
# Used by scripts/service-env to extract a minimal .env for deployment.
# Only these secrets reach the service; the master /opt/homelab/.env is never mounted.
#
# OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DEPLOY_KEY_B64: base64 ed25519 deploy key (write access) for
# github.com/technicalpickles/openclaw-workspace. deploy.sh decodes it to
# ssh/workspace_deploy_key for the one-time workspace clone. Unknown until the
# op:// ref exists in .env.template; deploy.sh degrades to no-clone with a warning.
#
# OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_GITHUB_TOKEN: fine-grained PAT scoped to just
# openclaw-workspace, Contents: Read and write. Used only by the in-container
# workspace-git-sync cron job (no ssh client in the container image, so the
# SSH deploy key above can't be used there) -- see
# docs/plans/2026-07-04-workspace-git-sync-picklelab-rollout.md. Unknown until
# the op:// ref exists in .env.template; deploy.sh degrades to no-sync-wiring
# with a warning, same as the deploy key above.
OPENCLAW_HOST
OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_TOKEN
OLLAMA_API_KEY
OPENROUTER_API_KEY
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN
GEMINI_API_KEY
OPENCLAW_ALLOWED_CHAT_IDS
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY
OPENCLAW_IMAGE
OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DEPLOY_KEY_B64
OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_GITHUB_TOKEN
# GOG_MCP_TOKEN: bearer token gog-mcp's HTTP endpoint requires. Passed to both the
# openclaw service (for mcp.json5's header interpolation) and the gog-mcp service
# (to check incoming requests). Unknown until the op:// ref exists in .env.template.
#
# OPENCLAW_PICKLECLAW_DEPLOY_KEY_B64: base64 ed25519 deploy key (read-only) for
# github.com/technicalpickles/pickleclaw. deploy.sh decodes it to
# ssh/pickleclaw_deploy_key to clone/pull gog-mcp's source. Unknown until the op://
# ref exists in .env.template; deploy.sh degrades to no-clone with a warning.
GOG_MCP_TOKEN
OPENCLAW_PICKLECLAW_DEPLOY_KEY_B64
